+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: Section III's multiplier test enumerates F_p^* and costs "
+        "O(p log k+k) modular operations with the constant-coefficient filter; "
+        "shipping measurements are filled by selftest (about five million "
+        "modular multiplications per instance), while the homogeneous-coefficient "
+        "route takes fewer than 100 exact operations once noticed."
